"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"26P-A2QGP38Fevb0VtebNA","review_id":"fSXfKjSgcTEdSXjzvR5wzQ","date":"2018-10-03T03:03:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387997388839722,"text_excerpt":"I had friends that were staying at the NOPSI hotel over the weekend. We visited the attached restaurant, Public Service, a couple times over the weekend. The restaurant is located on Baronne St between Canal and Poydras. Valet parking is available, and there are lots nearby. I found the service to be attentive - they did a good job of breaking down the menu options. The atmosphere of the restaurant is enhanced by the amazing renovation and decor. Food options are pretty wide (see photo of menu). I sampled Cajun poutine, crab cakes, gumbo, debris mac n cheese with short rib, watermelon salad, and shrimp & andouille croquettes. Everything was tasty. There is a full bar with a good selection..."},{"business_id":"26P-A2QGP38Fevb0VtebNA","review_id":"Ev5yVt2VFK7Rb3fstUsqQg","date":"2018-11-07T19:01:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9289298057556152,"text_excerpt":"We love the NOPSI Hotel, where Public Service is located. It is such a cool spot. Can't really review the restaurant without mentioning the hotel. The lobby is so inviting with a great bar, many TVs, great outdoor seating as well. Now as to the restaurant we went for brunch, excellent menu and great staff and very helpful. We were there over two hours with friends and enjoyed everything about our experience. As you can see from the photos we ordered many things in addition to the coffee, mimosas and cocktails. I ordered the burger and my wife got the Po-Boy and both were delicious and makes you proud of the New Orleans culinary scene. Go for breakfast, brunch or lunch, or cocktails at the..."},{"business_id":"26P-A2QGP38Fevb0VtebNA","review_id":"PgO-gwnxyt1D2cpoOV5Cng","date":"2018-04-19T13:45:09","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9199042320251465,"text_excerpt":"Everything I tried, the hush puppies, the poutine and the mushroom tagliatelle, was very tasty. Service was good and friendly, but our server seemed to have more ground to cover than she should have given the caliber of restaurant. The hotel housing Public Service is very nice, and the restaurant space itself is tastefully appointed but not really warm or intimate. Overall, it was a good but not overwhelming experience."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"26P-A2QGP38Fevb0VtebNA","photo_id":"s4V7E58LDaG3o730fr5j5w","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/s4V7E58LDaG3o730fr5j5w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.908463716506958},{"business_id":"26